WEBVTT

00:00:00.344 --> 00:00:01.205
Your Mac finally

00:00:01.016 --> 00:00:01.830
gets a volume

00:00:01.641 --> 00:00:02.797
slider for every

00:00:02.608 --> 00:00:03.080
app.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.791
Smorza just launched

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:05.593
Turn a call

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:05.923
down

00:00:06.089 --> 00:00:06.902
keep the music

00:00:06.714 --> 00:00:07.114
up

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:08.105
and send each

00:00:07.916 --> 00:00:08.576
app to the

00:00:08.388 --> 00:00:09.956
speakers or headphones

00:00:09.768 --> 00:00:10.510
you choose

00:00:11.032 --> 00:00:11.775
It lives in

00:00:11.587 --> 00:00:12.482
your menu bar

00:00:12.542 --> 00:00:13.355
and it installs

00:00:13.167 --> 00:00:14.381
no audio driver

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:15.301
It uses the

00:00:15.183 --> 00:00:16.421
audio taps Apple

00:00:16.233 --> 00:00:17.329
added in macOS

00:00:17.141 --> 00:00:18.331
14.4

00:00:18.848 --> 00:00:19.697
It's free and

00:00:19.509 --> 00:00:20.829
open source for

00:00:20.641 --> 00:00:21.867
Apple silicon and

00:00:21.679 --> 00:00:22.775
Intel Macs

00:00:23.363 --> 00:00:24.188
Full story on

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:24.860
the dashboard
